<title>SWITZERLAND: Swisscargo traffic up 3.6pct in Feb 97.</title>
<headline>Swisscargo traffic up 3.6pct in Feb 97.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swisscargo, the cargo arm of Swissair, said February 1997 cargo shipments totalled 130.4 million freight tonne kilometres FTK, up 3.6 percent on the same month last year.</p>
<p>Swisscargo' February 1997 traffic, expressed in million FTK, with percentage change on February 1996, was as follows:</p>
<p> Traffic area	Feb 1997   Pct change</p>
<p>					against Feb 96</p>
<p>		  (in million FTK)</p>
<p> Europe		  5.2	up    10.0pct</p>
<p> North America	42.7	down   7.5</p>
<p> South Atlantic	3.7	down  11.8</p>
<p> Middle East	   4.6	down  12.3</p>
<p> Japan		   9.6	up     9.0</p>
<p> Far East	     31.2	down  10.0</p>
<p> Africa		 12.1	up     5.1</p>
<p> Total worldwide   130.4	up     3.6</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
